# ───────────────────────── Dependencies ─────────────────────────
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# ───────────────────────── Build output ─────────────────────────
dist/
build/
client/dist/
.vite/
**/.vite/

# ─────────────────── Environment / secrets — NEVER COMMIT ───────────────────
# Real keys live only in these files locally. .env.example (placeholders) IS tracked.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
server/.env
client/.env
client/.env.local

# ───────────────────────── Logs ─────────────────────────
*.log
dev.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ───────────────────────── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# OneDrive drops these into synced folders. Same OneDrive that intermittently locks
# .git and makes a write fail with "permission denied" — retry, don't hand-edit.
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# ─────────── claude.ai/design sync — local tooling & generated machine state ───────────
.design-sync/
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/

# ─────────── Browser-test output ───────────
# shots.mjs, skim.mjs and cart.mjs render the real surfaces over CDP and write PNGs here.
# They are evidence for one run, regenerated on demand — a screenshot in version control
# goes stale the first time a token changes and then quietly lies about what ships.
#
# The rule named ONE directory because one existed. dash.mjs, shop.mjs and composed.mjs each
# write their own, and the reasoning above applies to every one of them — so it is a glob
# now rather than a list somebody has to remember to extend.
client/test/shots/
client/test/shots-*/
# …except the monetization gate's, which was already tracked before this rule generalised.
!client/test/shots-gate/
